nique ambiance that mountain has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy unique landscapes on the sound of the original soundtrack created by the lo-fi composer: WYS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244160/extras/cf967ba8858a983a88a7902ef80bf3c2.poster.avif?t=1755186149\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244160/extras/cf967ba8858a983a88a7902ef80bf3c2.webm?t=1755186149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244160/extras/cf967ba8858a983a88a7902ef80bf3c2.mp4?t=1755186149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
